--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: emit::mid
visibility: public
---
// One `extends` step. `secret` arrives as Mid's own private member, re-gated
// onto `emit/mid` — privacy crosses exactly one step (D4.12).
Mid: !type &Mid
  extends: ../base/Base
  pub tier: mid
